  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At https://vrchat.com/home/messages click \"Friend Requests\" at the top right.\nYou will see a list of all friend requests you've ever received.\nAn error message at the top claims that you will not see any new friend requests from users in this list.\nThat is incorrect. This only applies to friend requests which have been received, but not rejected yet. If you've declined a friend request, you'll still see future friend requests from that same user.\nI found that message confusing! Thought I'd been missing out on friend requests due to an unknown auto-ignore functionality 😅\nApologies for not including the actual message that's on the website. It doesn't appear if you have no ignored friend requests.",
